  "id": "continuous-improvement",
  "term": "continuous improvement",
  "definition": "Continuous improvement is the attitude or willingness to keep refining one’s work through repeated revision during learning or design so it gradually becomes better. In this context, it is viewed as supporting ongoing progress by helping increase success and reduce failure.",
